{"id":"cue-17-17000","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-17000","source_start_seconds":17,"source_end_seconds":18.62,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.62,"text":"还想对长景路进行锁喉"}
{"id":"cue-18-18620","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-17000","source_start_seconds":18.62,"source_end_seconds":19.36,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.74,"text":"毫无悬念"}
{"id":"cue-19-19360","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-17000","source_start_seconds":19.36,"source_end_seconds":20.34,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.98,"text":"直接一脚踢飞"}
{"id":"cue-20-20340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-17000","source_start_seconds":20.34,"source_end_seconds":20.84,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.5,"text":"那有人问"}
{"id":"cue-21-20840","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-17000","source_start_seconds":20.84,"source_end_seconds":21.86,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.02,"text":"这不是随便一扑"}
{"id":"cue-22-21860","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-17-17000","source_start_seconds":21.86,"source_end_seconds":23.02,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.16,"text":"长景路就倒下了吗"}
{"id":"cue-23-23020","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-23020","source_start_seconds":23.02,"source_end_seconds":24.32,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.3,"text":"甚至浑身挂满了狮子"}
