{"id":"cue-25-25080","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-23020","source_start_seconds":25.08,"source_end_seconds":26.56,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.48,"text":"其实这些都是小长景路"}
{"id":"cue-26-26560","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-23020","source_start_seconds":26.56,"source_end_seconds":27.3,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.74,"text":"成年长景路"}
{"id":"cue-27-27300","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-23020","source_start_seconds":27.3,"source_end_seconds":28.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.24,"text":"即使遇到一群狮子"}
{"id":"cue-28-28540","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-23-23020","source_start_seconds":28.54,"source_end_seconds":29.5,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.96,"text":"也能犹然犹豫"}
{"id":"cue-29-29500","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-29-29500","source_start_seconds":29.5,"source_end_seconds":30.74,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.24,"text":"一脚一个毫不费力"}
